# Environment
#
# `.env` is deliberately TRACKED — do not add it here.
#
# It is the only source of build configuration for the Cloudflare Pages deploy:
# the build runs on Cloudflare from this repo, Vite inlines VITE_-prefixed vars
# at build time, and the project has no environment variables set in its
# dashboard. Untracking it therefore ships a production bundle with no Supabase
# config at all, which disables multiplayer silently — the app degrades to
# local-only by design, so nothing errors and nothing looks wrong.
#
# It holds no secret. VITE_ vars are compiled into the public client bundle, and
# a Supabase anon key is public by construction. The real cost is that a clone or
# CI job points at the live project; AVE-971 (membership RLS) retires that, after
# which config can move to the Pages dashboard and this file can be ignored again.
.env.*
!.env.example

